representativeness":0.9310612678527832,"text_excerpt":"One of my favorite coffee places in the city. I'm not a real connoisseur, but I like their coffee and their flavored ice teas. What I really like about it is that it is a great space with natural light that is perfect for getting work done. It's also one of the few coffee shops right on the St. Charles streetcar line. Both of the guys that work here are super friendly and let you pay after you have your drink, which for some reason makes it more homey."},{"business_id":"euEHHwDtpFxR5P0e0T8Gjg","review_id":"VGcpbG6WQthRaC8YJYNfOA","date":"2015-07-16T05:03:02","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.927879810333252,"text_excerpt":"Their coffee is super strong, which is a plus for me. Their staff is also super friendly and very locals-friendly. Their menu is a bit limited, and the decor IS a little lackluster when you consider what you can find in other coffee shops located nearby, but their prices are good, and the service I've received from the staff means more to me than what's on the walls. This is a great place to go for coffee before work or to take a bit of a break from the office."},{"business_id":"euEHHwDtpFxR5P0e0T8Gjg","review_id":"RN0yTozvijkDR8IIc69MdQ","date":"2013-06-03T22:25:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9212890863418579,"text_excerpt":"Love Krewe Du Brew and try to take new people here to introduce them to this great coffee spot as well. This is a little coffee shop done right! The owners are really nice, very knowledgable, friendly, and helpful. You can tell that they really invest in their customers and the community. Wifi is free, so it's a nice spot to relax and get out of the house to do work or hang-out and chat. There's plenty of off-street parking, so that's a bonus as well. I would recommend checking this place out if you're tired of the box chains and want to great coffee in a nice atmosphere."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"euEHHwDtpFxR5P0e0T8Gjg","photo_id":"qDnw5D16WpbFSr9HCwFpvw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qDnw5D16WpbFSr9HCwFpvw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8862190246582031},{"business_id":"euEHHwDtpFxR5P0e0T8Gjg","photo_id":"KeGBB6xvQvqZ_DFoBKEufg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/KeGBB6xvQvqZ_DFoBKEufg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8360172510147095},{"business_id":"euEHHwDtpFxR5P0e0T8Gjg","photo_id":"HN0kHk3K23LITPfYwFzbQg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HN0kHk3K23LITPfYwFzbQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7626937627792358}]},"notebook_case":null}
